# MiniMax-M2.5 (MiniMax, 2026): a model of the M2 series trained extensively with
# reinforcement learning in hundreds of thousands of real-world environments, for
# coding, agentic tool use and search, and office work; it runs SWE-Bench Verified 37%
# faster than M2.1. Its config is M2's, and so is its architecture: 230B parameters,
# 10B of them active a token.
use minimax_m2
